{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V4H1wszCt4FJV4NQXjUweb","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me provide a comprehensive report.\n\n## FINDINGS REPORT\n\n### 1. BASELINE MEASUREMENT FILES (With Timing Data)\n\n**Location:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/baseline/`\n\n**Files Found:**\n- **apc000.json** (1.05 MB) - Baseline metrics for APC 0 configuration\n- **apc100.json** (1.46 MB) - Baseline metrics for APC 100 configuration  \n- **apc300.json** (2.09 MB) - Baseline metrics for APC 300 configuration\n\n**Text Summary Files with Round 0 & STARK excl trace data:**\n- **spec_apc000.txt** - Contains structured timing breakdown for APC 0\n- **spec_apc100.txt** - Contains structured timing breakdown for APC 100\n- **spec_apc300.txt** - Contains structured timing breakdown for APC 300\n\n**Key Round 0 Timing Data from spec files:**\n\n**APC 0:**\n```\nSTARK (excl. trace):    2.15s (2149 ms)  (42.4%)\n  Constraints:          1.29s (1290 ms)  (25.4%)\n    LogUp GKR:          0.99s (989 ms)   (19.5%)\n    Round 0:            0.18s (178 ms)   (3.5%)  ← Round 0 timing\n    MLE Rounds:         0.12s (118 ms)   (2.3%)\n```\n\n**APC 100:**\n```\nSTARK (excl. trace):    2.16s (2159 ms)  (35.7%)\n  Constraints:          1.40s (1398 ms)  (23.1%)\n    LogUp GKR:          0.78s (783 ms)   (12.9%)\n    Round 0:            0.46s (463 ms)   (7.6%)  ← Round 0 timing\n    MLE Rounds:         0.15s (149 ms)   (2.5%)\n```\n\n**APC 300:**\n```\nSTARK (excl. trace):    2.48s (2478 ms)  (36.0%)\n  Constraints:          1.66s (1663 ms)  (24.1%)\n    LogUp GKR:          0.82s (818 ms)   (11.9%)\n    Round 0:            0.66s (663 ms)   (9.6%)  ← Round 0 timing\n    MLE Rounds:         0.18s (180 ms)   (2.6%)\n```\n\nThe JSON files contain detailed constraint metrics (constraint_deg, constraints, interactions) per AIR instance.\n\n---\n\n### 2. SymbolicConstraints::from<SymbolicConstraintsDag> IMPLEMENTATION\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/stark-backend/src/air_builders/symbolic/dag.rs`\n\n**Lines:** 385-422 (with reference implementation at lines 331-382)\n\n**Implementation Details:**\n\n```rust\n// Lines 385-416: Reference impl for &'a SymbolicConstraintsDag<F>\nimpl<'a, F: Field> From<&'a SymbolicConstraintsDag<F>> for SymbolicConstraints<F> {\n    fn from(dag: &'a SymbolicConstraintsDag<F>) -> Self {\n        let exprs = dag.constraints.to_symbolic_expressions();  // Line 387\n        let constraints = dag\n            .constraints\n            .constraint_idx\n            .iter()\n            .map(|&idx| exprs[idx].as_ref().clone())\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n        let interactions = dag\n            .interactions\n            .iter()\n            .map(|interaction| {\n                let fields = interaction\n                    .message\n                    .iter()\n                    .map(|&idx| exprs[idx].as_ref().clone())\n                    .collect();\n                let count = exprs[interaction.count].as_ref().clone();\n                Interaction {\n                    message: fields,\n                    count,\n                    bus_index: interaction.bus_index,\n                    count_weight: interaction.count_weight,\n                }\n            })\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n        SymbolicConstraints {\n            constraints,\n            interactions,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Lines 419-422: Owned version delegates to reference impl\nimpl<F: Field> From<SymbolicConstraintsDag<F>> for SymbolicConstraints<F> {\n    fn from(dag: SymbolicConstraintsDag<F>) -> Self {\n        (&dag).into()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**What It Does:**\n\n1. **Converts DAG back to tree form** - Calls `to_symbolic_expressions()` (lines 334-381) which reconstructs all `Arc<SymbolicExpression<F>>` from the flattened DAG nodes in **topological order**\n2. **Rebuilds constraints** - Maps indices from