{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C9VpruiA5bKNQvhwV1SbpM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Current Performance Analysis\n2\t\n3\t## Status\n4\t\n5\tThe batch-round0-coset-parallel commit (74134b4e) appears to introduce a severe performance\n6\tregression on the pairing benchmark. The benchmark fails to complete within 2 minutes (expected\n7\t~6 seconds). This prevents fresh measurements.\n8\t\n9\tData below uses the most recent successful measurements:\n10\t- Post defer-round0-d2h-sync: from powdr/results/pairing/apc{100,300}/metrics.json (Apr 10)\n11\t- Post stacked-reduction: from log.md entries (measured by that agent)\n12\t- Baseline: from autoopt-results/baseline/\n13\t\n14\t## STARK excl trace (ms)\n15\t\n16\t| Config | Baseline | Post d2h-sync | Post stacked-red. | vs Baseline |\n17\t|--------|----------|---------------|---------------------|-------------|\n18\t| APC 0  | 2149     | 2146          | ~2146*              | -3ms        |\n19\t| APC 100| 2159     | 2077          | ~2077*              | -82ms       |\n20\t| APC 300| 2478     | 2358          | 2195                | -283ms      |\n21\t\n22\t*Estimated (stacked reduction has negligible effect at APC 0/100)\n23\t\n24\t## APC 300 STARK excl trace breakdown (estimated current = post stacked-red.)\n25\t\n26\t| Component         | Baseline | Current est. | vs Baseline |\n27\t|-------------------|----------|-------------|-------------|\n28\t| Round 0           | 663ms    | ~569ms      | -94ms       |\n29\t| LogUp GKR         | 818ms    | ~791ms      | -27ms       |\n30\t| MLE Rounds        | 180ms    | ~180ms      | 0ms         |\n31\t| Trace Commit      | 403ms    | ~403ms      | 0ms         |\n32\t| Stacked Reduction | 308ms    | ~147ms      | -161ms      |\n33\t| WHIR              | 101ms    | ~100ms      | -1ms        |\n34\t| Other             | 5ms      | ~5ms        | 0ms         |\n35\t| **Total**         | **2478** | **~2195**   | **-283ms**  |\n36\t\n37\t## Scaling ratio (APC 300 / APC 0)\n38\t\n39\t| Metric | Baseline | Current est. |\n40\t|--------|----------|-------------|\n41\t| STARK excl trace | 1.153 | ~1.014 |\n42\t\n43\t## Per-component scaling (APC 300 vs APC 0, current est.)\n44\t\n45\t| Component         | APC 0   | APC 300 | Ratio | Direction |\n46\t|-------------------|---------|---------|-------|-----------|\n47\t| Round 0           | 175ms   | 569ms   | 3.25x | WORSE     |\n48\t| LogUp GKR         | 1007ms  | 791ms   | 0.79x | Better    |\n49\t| MLE Rounds        | 118ms   | 180ms   | 1.53x | WORSE     |\n50\t| Trace Commit      | 519ms   | 403ms   | 0.78x | Better    |\n51\t| Stacked Reduction | 113ms   | 147ms   | 1.30x | WORSE     |\n52\t| WHIR              | 218ms   | 100ms   | 0.46x | Better    |\n53\t\n54\tRound 0 is the dominant scaling offender: +394ms at APC 300 vs APC 0.\n55\t\n56\t## GPU Kernel Analysis (from baseline nsight, APC 300)\n57\t\n58\tRound 0 kernels: ~479ms GPU time total\n59\t- zerocheck coset_parallel<true>: 221ms (539 instances)\n60\t- logup r0 coset_parallel<true>: 196ms (396 instances)\n61\t- Non-coset-parallel variants: ~62ms\n62\t\n63\tRound 0 CPU overhead: 663 - 479 = 184ms (baseline), ~90ms post d2h-sync\n64\t\n65\tLogUp GKR kernels: ~666ms GPU time\n66\t- evaluate_interactions_gkr<true>: 374ms (486 instances)\n67\t- evaluate_interactions_gkr<false>: 54ms (305 instances)\n68\t- fractional_sumcheck_gkr: ~238ms\n69\t\n70\tLogUp GKR CPU overhead: 818 - 666 = 152ms\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GNjZk7xXZVohfSUdij8Mkz","session_id":"b7092ff3-dad3-4115-bd08-06aa847648b3","uuid":"12dc5294-1e58-43c6-904d-e3848c3654bf","timestamp":"2026-04-11T07:53:23.416Z"}
