{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CawotcPZjBt68k2PJQkBqv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Plan: Pre-compute Round 0 Logup Interaction Rules\n2\t\n3\t## Goal\n4\t\n5\tEliminate redundant per-AIR DAG construction, rule compilation, and rule encoding/H2D transfers in the Round 0 logup path. At APC 300, ~370 AIRs with interactions per segment (2 segments) each rebuild the same static symbolic data on every `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys` call. This optimization moves all static computation to keygen time (`AirDataGpu::new`), leaving only runtime-dependent weight computation in the hot loop.\n6\t\n7\tSecondary goal: parallelize Phase 2 (D2H + transpose + IDFT) using rayon to reduce sequential CPU processing of 623 AIR results.\n8\t\n9\tReference state (commit 6fccffce, post-d2h-sync and post-stacked-reduction):\n10\t- Round 0: APC 0 = 175ms, APC 300 = 569ms\n11\t- STARK excl trace: APC 0 = 2146ms, APC 300 = 2195ms\n12\t- Scaling ratio (APC 300 / APC 0): 1.023\n13\t\n14\tOriginal baseline (pre-optimization): Round 0 APC 300 = 663ms, STARK excl trace APC 300 = 2478ms.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7092ff3-dad3-4115-bd08-06aa847648b3","uuid":"0a0bcf4f-2eb7-4cad-8c1b-edf47edd591f","timestamp":"2026-04-11T08:02:52.507Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-11-0945-precompute-round0-logup-rules/plan.md","content":"# Plan: Pre-compute Round 0 Logup Interaction Rules\n\n## Goal\n\nEliminate redundant per-AIR DAG construction, rule compilation, and rule encoding/H2D transfers in the Round 0 logup path. At APC 300, ~370 AIRs with interactions per segment (2 segments) each rebuild the same static symbolic data on every `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys` call. This optimization moves all static computation to keygen time (`AirDataGpu::new`), leaving only runtime-dependent weight computation in the hot loop.\n\nSecondary goal: parallelize Phase 2 (D2H + transpose + IDFT) using rayon to reduce sequential CPU processing of 623 AIR results.\n\nReference state (commit 6fccffce, post-d2h-sync and post-stacked-reduction):\n- Round 0: APC 0 = 175ms, APC 300 = 569ms\n- STARK excl trace: APC 0 = 2146ms, APC 300 = 2195ms\n- Scaling ratio (APC 300 / APC 0): 1.023\n\nOriginal baseline (pre-optimization): Round 0 APC 300 = 663ms, STARK excl trace APC 300 = 2478ms.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":388}}}
