{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015Ej1GdAWS9PXetaghrZMcU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017Z9axLcRKTRoqCbQiXkPnA","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-11-0945-precompute-round0-logup-rules/plan.md","old_string":"1. **DAG construction + rule compilation + rule encoding** (~0.15-0.3ms per AIR): Involves `SymbolicConstraints::from` (Arc tree rebuild), `SymbolicDagBuilder::add_expr` (FxHashMap lookups, recursive traversal), `SymbolicRulesGpu::new` (buffer scheduling, three-address code gen), and `Codec::encode` (per-rule encoding). This is the dominant per-AIR CPU cost and is entirely static — depends only on the AIR's constraint structure.","new_string":"1. **`SymbolicConstraints::from` + DAG construction + rule compilation + rule encoding** (~0.15-0.3ms per AIR): `SymbolicConstraints::from` rebuilds the full `Arc<SymbolicExpression>` tree from the flattened DAG (allocates `Vec<Arc<...>>`, clones every expression). Note: this call runs for ALL 623 AIRs per segment, not just the ~370 with interactions, because the resulting `single_air_constraints` is also used for a `debug_assert_eq!`. After it, `SymbolicDagBuilder::add_expr` (FxHashMap lookups, recursive traversal), `SymbolicRulesGpu::new` (buffer scheduling, three-address code gen), and `Codec::encode` (per-rule encoding) add further static overhead for the ~370 interaction-bearing AIRs. This is the dominant per-AIR CPU cost and is entirely static — depends only on the AIR's constraint structure."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":126169,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_